headless = no output device (miniaudio noDevice graph, 48 kHz stereo);
callers pull mixed output manually via ReadFrames. Used by the
--audio-graph-test self-test and any CI box without an audio device.

Exact early reflections from the geometry. While any are set they
replace the histogram's one-tap-per-bin guess in the impulse response;
an empty list goes back to the guess.

Reads audio.occlusion.<Surface>.db / .cutoff_hz and audio.occlusion.smoothing;
a key that is absent keeps the engine default, so a project only writes
the rows it changes.
